h took away a bigger part of him he  knows that accepting his help is very  difficult for alma but he begs her to  let him do what he has to at night for  the final match boyka goes against igor  zurab's best fighter who has been  mocking boyka since the day he arrived  igor is especially furious at boyka  because he has a threat to his position  in the gang he takes all his frustration  out and showers him with repeated  attacks he manages to put up a tough  fight making boyka's lower back his main  target but the direction of the fight  changes when boyka lands a double midair  kick on him following that he beats igor  black and blue making him bleed  profusely until he passes out with this  he wins the entire tournament and alma's  debt is paid however zureb has already  predicted the outcome and prepared for  it he stops boyka and reveals that he  has to fight one last man for their deal  to be over boyka only has a few hours  before his meeting in budapest which is  very crucial for his career but he  doesn't want to leave without saving  alma hence he asks the manager to wait  until the next morning and gets ready to  fight the final champion the opponent is  koshmar the beast who has fought and  killed all of his opponents in the  russian prison he is brought into the  arena in chains because of his violent  nature the fight starts but boyka is  already too tired he tries his best but  his attacks seem to do koshmar little to  no harm because of his physique the  beast lands several punches on him  before kicking him in the jaw boyka  falls down because of the impact and has  a hard time standing back up seconds  before losing the fight he gathers  strength and stands up again but is  again slammed to the floor when koshmar  is almost sure that he is one boyka  takes him by surprise and pushes him  back with a kick after that the fight  tilts to his side he holds the beast in  an arm lock breaking his right arm  before kicking him out of the ring with  this he finally wins the match but zurab  is still not ready to let go of alma he  makes his minion attack boyka while he  tries to run away with the girl boyka is  on the ground at his lowest when he sees  alma being pulled outside with renewed  motivation and anger he attacks the  guards and kills them all at last he  gets his hands on zurab and tackles him  to the ground boika is shot in the  process but his pain is overshadowed by  his anger eventually zureb is strangled  to death alma tries to help boyka but he  stops her asking her if he has her  forgiveness some time later the police  arrive and arrest him before being  pulled away he again inquires if she  forgives him but alma doesn't give him a  reply then boyka is put back into a  russian prison a month later alma comes  to visit him and tells him that he is  forgiven boika is relieved for the first  time in months even though his plan to  become a professional fighter failed in  the last scene we see him fighting in  the prisons arena continuing to hold the  title of the undisputed subscribe for  more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching

